May sinh: javax.servlet -> jakarta.servlet o 6 lop + 6 test, web.xml 6.0, servlet-api 6.0.0, jsp-api 3.1.1.
Sua tay: servlet-api scope compile -> provided; JSTL 1.2 -> Jakarta Tags 3.0 (+ loai el-api); report.jsp uri jakarta.tags.core;
Dockerfile tomcat:10.1-jdk17-temurin. 49 test xanh JDK 17/21; golden master giong het tren Tomcat 10.1.62.
---
 Dockerfile                                    |  4 +--
 pom.xml                                       | 28 +++++++++++++------
 .../java/com/thuvien/servlet/BookServlet.java |  8 +++---
 .../com/thuvien/servlet/LoginServlet.java     | 12 ++++----
 .../com/thuvien/servlet/ReaderServlet.java    |  8 +++---
 .../com/thuvien/servlet/ReportServlet.java    | 10 +++----
 src/main/webapp/WEB-INF/web.xml               |  6 ++--
 src/main/webapp/report.jsp                    |  2 +-
 .../servlet/BookServletMuonSachTest.java      |  6 ++--
 .../servlet/BookServletTraSachTest.java       |  6 ++--
 .../servlet/BookServletXoaSachTest.java       |  6 ++--
